{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648460/extras/OMB_gameplay_01.gif?t=1744203549\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s included in the demo</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play 12 handpicked stages from the full game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plus, discover 3 hidden bonus stages! Can you find them all?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get an early taste of various gimmicks and mechanics featured in the full release!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes \u201cUndo\u201d and \u201cRedo\u201d buttons, making retries quick and easy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648460/extras/OMB_gameplay_03.gif?t=1744203549\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is the game about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine the buttons popped out of your controllers and leapt right into the screen. That's the unique concept behind <strong>One More Button</strong>. You play as the adorable circle button. To move around, you have to press the arrow buttons scattered around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648460/extras/OMB_gameplay_04.gif?t=1744203549\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648460?t=1744203549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648460/c7b66182bb98b38f5f4898ec442ece45066d18de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744203549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648460/672f86963bf05e54c77ffce28909c2924e2b4c0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744203549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st